OL,3,AJeff Bezos says he was 'heavily        
OL,4,Ainvolved' in casting Robert Pattinson  
OL,5,Aas new Bond                            
OL,7,FThis will be the first 007 film in the 
OL,8,Fofficial series not under the creative 
OL,9,Fcontrol of the Broccoli family, who had
OL,10,Foverseen the franchise since the first 
OL,11,Fmovie in 1962. Amazon purchased MGM,   
OL,12,Fwhich co-owns the franchise, in 2022.  
